<title>USA: Edison Brothers Stores Inc Q3 Nov 2 net.</title>
<headline>Edison Brothers Stores Inc Q3 Nov 2 net.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.52     loss	 $3.77</p>
<p> Net loss		  11,500     loss	83,200</p>
<p> Revs		     255,200		  319,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,202		   22,087</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.45     loss	 $5.23</p>
<p> Net loss		  54,400     loss     115,400</p>
<p> Revs		     782,100		  972,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,180		   22,063</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 net loss excluding $7.8 million restructuring and reorganization charge was $3.7 million, or $0.17/shr, versus year-ago net loss before charges and interest expense of $14.2 million, or $0.64/shr.  </p>
<p>Restructing and reorganization charges primarily related to legal and consulting fees and reserves for store closings.</p>
<p>Nine-months net loss in 1996 before charges was $14.6 million, or $0.66/shr, versus net loss before charges in the year-ago period of $24 million, or $1.09/shr.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
